"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[96322],{96322:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/suspicious-people.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Suspicious People\\"\\n          author=\\"Keigo Higashino\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Random House Korea\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2009-07-13\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788925533308\\"\\n          rating=3\\n          tags=\\"mystery\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nConsisting of a total of seven short stories, it goes beyond the simple framework of ```finding the culprit``` and delves into the dark desires of humans hidden in ordinary daily life.  \\nAs the title suggests, in a situation where all characters look <mark>suspicious</mark>, the reader is left questioning what is true and who to trust.  \\n<br>\\nEvery character has suspicious circumstances and motives. In other words, naturally everyone is a suspect.  \\n<br>\\nReaders realize how easily they fall into prejudice and make hasty judgments.  \\n<br>\\nOn what basis do you judge and trust others?"}')}}]);